SDK v11 extraction summary
==========================

RTL8197 variants observed in SDK configs:
- RTL_8197F, RTL_8197F_FPGA
- RTL_8197F_GW / AP
- RTL_8197F_VG and board revisions V355I, V612, V672, V622G
- SPINAND_RTL8197F_VG_* board configs

RTL8367D/RB/R switch facts ported:
- RTL8367D chip-id 0x6642
- CPU_PORT_MASK 0x1219
- CPU_CTRL 0x121a
- unknown/broadcast flood masks 0x0890/0x0891/0x0892
- unknown IPv4/IPv6/L2 multicast action regs 0x08c9/0x08cb/0x08cd
- unknown unicast action reg 0x09c0
- EXT_PORT0/1/2 enum is 16/17/18 in SDK; RD05 uses EXT1/port6 in the Linux DTS
